          "from": "FACE /eɪ/ (RP), e.g. bait",
          "to": "[æj~aj], bait [bæjʔ]",
          "note": "Cockney /æj/ corresponds to RP /eɪ/ and is realised as [æj~aj]."
        }
      ]
    },
